'''Examplestad''' is a small, entirely fictional harbour town on the coast of [[Imaginaria]], known for its [[Lighthouse walks|lighthouse walks]] and fish soup.<ref>Invented for the Wanderlust test suite.</ref>
[[File:Examplestad harbour.jpg|thumb|The harbour at dusk]]

==Understand==
The town grew around a fishing harbour. Summers are mild and winters are windy.
<!-- an editor comment that should never appear in the text -->

==Get around==
Most sights are within walking distance of the harbour.

===By tram===
A single heritage tram line runs from the station to the lighthouse every 15 minutes.

===By bicycle===
Bicycles can be rented at the station.

